        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Exposes only 2 basic scalar metrics in `measure_morphoeval()` without testing Péclet upstream/downstream dipolar flux asymmetry, Rugosa vs Scleractinia divergence, cross-taxa septa correlation, or specimen segmentation parity." ;
